OL,3,GNEWSANew owner sought for port at      
OL,4,Acentre of Chinese investment row       
OL,6,FA new owner has been sought for a      
OL,7,FHighland port at the centre of a row   
OL,8,Fover Chinese investment.               
OL,10,FArdersier Port, near Nairn, is being   
OL,11,Fredeveloped as a hub for the renewable 
OL,12,Fenergy sector and a planned extension  
OL,13,Fwas approved by councillors earlier    
OL,14,Fthis year.                             
OL,16,FIn March, Chinese renewable energy     
OL,17,Fcompany Ming Yang said its plans to    
OL,18,Fopen a #1.5bn wind turbine             
OL,19,Fmanufacturing plant at the site had    
OL,20,Fbeen blocked by the UK government.     
