OL,3,GNEWSANew owner sought for port at      
OL,4,Acentre of Chinese investment row       
OL,6,FBut a spokesperson said the turbines   
OL,7,Ffrom the facility would not be suitable
OL,8,Ffor UK offshore wind projects and it   
OL,9,Fcould not support their use.           
